# Check every text file out with Unix (LF) line endings on every platform.
#
# "text=auto" alone checks files out with the platform's own line endings, so
# on Windows (including the Windows build in the release workflow) every file
# became CRLF, and "gofmt -l" then reported every Go file as unformatted.
# gofmt, the Makefile and the shell scripts all need LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
